00:00:07.447 --> 00:00:09.700
"I know those brows."

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:10.960
Are you ready?

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.279
- [Lily] Yes.

00:00:12.279 --> 00:00:13.709
- [Kelly] Let's go people

00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:16.320
♪ I know those brows ♪

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.540
- He is on my right, come on over!

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.497
Okay Peter, I think you're,

00:00:21.865 --> 00:00:22.895
this is you,

00:00:22.895 --> 00:00:24.884
And this is Peter.

00:00:24.884 --> 00:00:25.717
Okay.

00:00:26.884 --> 00:00:29.634
This is the Blake Shelton podium.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.463
- I love it!

00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:32.296
- What?

00:00:32.296 --> 00:00:33.129
- Blake gave me this podium because

00:00:33.129 --> 00:00:35.090
he didn't think my show is,

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:35.950
he thought we were cheap

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:36.990
when we played a game

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.420
so we built this for him.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.469
- I like it!

00:00:39.469 --> 00:00:41.060
- So he just wanted some
free billing, that's all.

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:42.726
- Yeah, yeah. What he wants to do is win,

00:00:42.726 --> 00:00:43.559
but he doesn't!

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.489
(audience cheering)

00:00:47.489 --> 00:00:49.487
- I'm just saying major!

00:00:49.487 --> 00:00:50.430
All right here we go.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:51.890
Here's how the game works.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:55.170
A pair of famous eyebrows
will appear on the screen.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.320
Whoever buzzes, you gotta push the buzzer,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.660
whoever buzzes in first gets to guess.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.340
If you get it right, you get a point.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.770
There are no steals.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:04.200
Most points win.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.560
And we're playing for the audience,

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:06.920
so don't fail them.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.190
All right if Lily wins, all the women

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:11.030
in the audience are walking out of here

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:12.500
with a personally signed bottle

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.009
of Lily's Haven perfume.

00:01:14.009 --> 00:01:16.689
(audience cheers)

00:01:16.689 --> 00:01:17.620
